title: Esentutl Copy of Locked/Sensitive File
id: 69da7910-5017-4598-9c5a-0ff70ef387b2
status: experimental
description: Detects esentutl.exe with /y (copy) used to copy locked or sensitive files such as ntds.dit or registry hives by reading them at the volume level, a data-access and credential-collection technique.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1005/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '\\esentutl.exe'
    CommandLine|contains: '/y'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'ntds'
      - '.dit'
      - '\\SAM'
      - 'SYSTEM'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Database maintenance
level: high
tags:
  - attack.collection
  - attack.t1005
